{
 "version": "v14",
 "rule": "Land provinces start with the side of the Rizia-Wehlen border (borders_land layer of the source map) that holds the province area. Zille (with the Wiktrany/Zille/Nanta/Isor/Munat cities) and the Wehlen region incl. Kratsna, Grodzizg, Rotsla and the Kreleck Islands are Wehlen; the Brenas region (Dapalle, Marbelas ...) and the Mave Nortus city are Rizia. v14: the Derdia strip south of the Wehlen-Derdia border (6 cells, 1-2 provinces deep) starts as Derdia; its 7th province Yol is a Derdian city that is IMPASSABLE (no links, no units). All sea provinces are neutral (no owner).",
 "ship_rule": "Rizia may place ships at start only in the 7 seas listed in rizia_ship_placement: 2 on the west coast and 5 on the east coast, the seas closest to Rizian land on each side.",
 "west_ship_seas_note": "The west Rizian coast (Praia Velha border point at y~7120 down to Costa Dalle / Marbelas) had no sea provinces in v12. v13 extends the sea to the bottom edge with S54-S57; the two bottom seas S56 Costa Dalle Waters and S57 Marbelas Bight are the only seas whose coast is Rizian (S57 touches Rizian land, S56 lies directly offshore of it), so they are the 2 west ship-placement seas. S54/S55 lie off the Wehlen-held Praia Velha / Santa Calla coast and are neutral without ship placement.",
 "east_ship_seas_note": "East: S37, S30, S32, S31 touch the Rizian coast at the Mave Nortus inlet / Tarnes; the 5th sea is S26 Tarnes Waters (owner choice in review 1, instead of S25 Tirsa Banks which only touches the Wehlen Tirsa/Venna coast). S26 lies off Tarnes, north of S31/S32.",
 "counts": {
  "rizia": 29,
  "wehlen": 93,
  "derdia": 7,
  "derdia_passable": 6,
  "neutral_sea": 57,
  "rizia_ship_seas": 7
 },
